            "title": "康方生物昨斥逾千萬購回20萬股",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">康方生物(09926)公布，於11月18日透過受託人於公開市場上以1,200萬港元購買20萬股公司股份。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17213258-%e5%ba%b7%e6%96%b9%e7%94%9f%e7%89%a9%e6%98%a8%e6%96%a5%e9%80%be%e5%8d%83%e8%90%ac%e8%b3%bc%e5%9b%9e20%e8%90%ac%e8%82%a1",
